---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaSection from '../components/CtaSection.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How I think"
  description="Deanna Glaze — product designer and player-coach working across AI, publishing, and digital health."
  theme="aurora"
>
  <section class="section--tight">
    <div class="container about">
      <div class="about__portrait">
        <img
          src="/images/about/workshop.jpg"
          alt="Deanna leading an audience-mapping workshop, smiling in front of a wall of grouped sticky notes"
          width="480"
          height="600"
          loading="eager"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="about__copy prose">
        <h1>How I think</h1>
        <p>
          <strong>I like understanding complicated systems made up of people.</strong> I've worked as a product designer, UX director, and design strategist, but those titles describe where I happened to sit, not how I think.
        </p>
        <p>
          The most interesting problems rarely arrive with the same title attached to them. Sometimes the greatest contribution I can make is designing an interaction model or uncovering a viable product strategy. Other times it's building a design team, mentoring individuals, or helping an org rethink how product, design, and engineering work together.
        </p>
        <p>
          Outside of product work, I explore those same questions through books and writing. I founded <a
            href="https://aerialbooks.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
          >Aerial Books</a> because reading and writing have always been another way for me to understand people. That curiosity has shaped not only how I write, but how I approach every problem worth solving.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaSection />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 3fr);
    gap: var(--space-8);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about__portrait img {
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .about {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about__portrait img {
      max-width: 320px;
    }
  }
</style>
